","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"creep"},{"text":"தரு","lemma":"தரு","gloss":"auxiliary verb"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to creep over"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செய்வுறு","parts":[{"text":"செய்வுறு","lemma":"செய்வுறு","gloss":"beautifully crafted"}],"gloss":"beautifully crafted","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பாவை","parts":[{"text":"பாவை","lemma":"பாவை","gloss":"doll"}],"gloss":"doll"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மெய்","parts":[{"text":"மெய்","lemma":"மெய்","gloss":"body"}],"gloss":"body"},{"surface":"பிறிது","parts":[{"text":"பிறிது","lemma":"பிறிது","gloss":"other"}],"gloss":"changed"},{"surface":"ஆகுதல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"தல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"becoming"},{"surface":"அறியாதோரே","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"know"},{"text":"யா","lemma":"யா","gloss":"negative marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"euphonic"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"pronominal suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"he who does not know indeed"}]}],"literal":"The sun's heat abating, to reach the hills, / bearing affliction, the sorrowful evening rises. / Where is he, I wonder, who completes his desired task? / \"She will grieve painfully,\" he does not think, alas! / As the caressing, gentle wind strikes my body and creeps over, / like a beautifully crafted doll, my / body becoming changed, he does not know indeed.","translation":"As the sun's fierce heat abates and it sinks behind the hills, the sorrowful evening rises, bearing heavy affliction. Where is he, I wonder, who went to complete his desired task? Alas, he does not think, \"She will grieve painfully.\" As the caressing, gentle breeze strikes and creeps over my body, my form, once like a beautifully crafted doll, changes and wastes away—and he does not even know.","modern":"சூரியனின் வெப்பம் தணிந்து அது மலைகளுக்குப் பின்னே மறைய, துன்பத்தைச் சுமந்து கொண்டு இந்தத் துயரமான மாலைப் பொழுது வருகிறது. தான் விரும்பிய கடமையை முடிக்கச் சென்றவர் இப்போது எங்கே இருக்கிறாரோ? \"அவள் வருந்துவாள்\" என்று அவர் நினைக்கவில்லையே, அந்தோ! உடலைத் தொட்டுத் தழுவி வீசும் மெல்லிய காற்று என் மேல் பட்டுப் பரவும்போது, அழகாகச் செய்யப்பட்ட பொம்மை போன்ற என் உடல் வேறுபட்டு (மெலிந்து) போவதை அவர் அறியவில்லையே!","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her close friend during the painful hours of evening. Her lover has departed to perform a duty, leaving her alone. The onset of evening, a classic motif of the Neytal landscape, brings intense feelings of loneliness and pining. The evening is personified as carrying a heavy burden of affliction, mirroring the heroine's own state. The gentle breeze, which usually brings comfort, now strikes her body painfully, causing her once doll-like beauty to waste away. She laments that her lover, far away and focused on his task, is completely unaware of her physical and emotional decline.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[2.1,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.6],[3.6,3.7],[3.7,4.9],[4.9,5.3],[5.3,5.5],[5.5,6.2],[6.2,6.9],[6.9,7.4],[7.4,7.8],[7.8,7.8],[7.8,8.2],[8.2,9.18],[9.18,10.77],[10.77,11.01],[11.01,11.01],[11.01,11.5],[11.84,12.01],[12.19,12.9],[12.9,13.5],[13.5,13.8],[13.8,14.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,2.25],[2.25,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.7,3.8],[3.8,4.1],[4.1,5.2],[5.2,5.6],[5.6,5.9],[5.9,6.6],[6.6,6.81],[7.03,8.3],[8.3,8.65],[8.65,8.91],[9.0,9.43],[9.43,10.54],[10.54,11.06],[11.24,11.6],[11.6,13.0],[13.0,13.3],[13.36,13.78],[14.04,14.45],[14.45,15.4],[15.4,15.9],[15.9,16.2]]},"sync":[[["சுடர்","sun"],["சினம்","heat"]],[["தணிந்து","having abated"]],[["குன்றம்","hill"]],[["சேர","to reach"]],[["படர்","affliction"],["சுமந்து","bearing"]],[["சுமந்து","bearing"],["எழுதரு","rising"]],[["பையுள்","sorrowful"]],[["மாலை","evening"]],[["யாண்டு","where"],["உளர்","is he"]],[["கொல்லோ","I wonder"]],[["வேண்டு","desired"],["வினை","task"]],[["முடிநர்","he who completes"]],[["இன்னாது","painfully"]],[["இன்னாது","painfully"],["இரங்கும்","will grieve"]],[["என்னார்","he does not think"]],[["அன்னோ","alas"]],[["தைவரல்","caressing"]],[["அசை","gentle"],["வளி","wind"]],[["மெய்","body"],["பாய்ந்து","striking"]],[["பாய்ந்து","striking"],["ஊர்தர","to creep over"]],[["செய்வுறு","beautifully crafted"]],[["பாவை","doll"]],[["அன்ன","like"],["என்","my"]],[["மெய்","body"],["பிறிது","changed"]],[["பிறிது","changed"],["ஆகுதல்","becoming"]],[["அறியாதோரே","he who does not know indeed"]],[["அறியாதோரே","he who does not know indeed"]]]}